  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "If you represent a buyer or seller in a real estate transaction, you can often expect to receive your check at closing or the following business day after the transaction closes, depending upon the time of closing. If you are unable to attend closing, please contact us to make arrangements for your funds to be wired to you upon the completion of closing. We know that Realtors operate mostly on commission, so it is our commitment to you to handle these details as quickly as possible to get you paid!",
   "links": [],
   "region": "main"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "At Vaughn Law it is our goal to assist all parties in getting to closing! [Contact us](https://dvaughnlaw.com/vaughnlaw/contact/) to learn more about how Vaughn Law can simplify your closings.",
